0	# InkOS — Sprint 3 Design Spec: Client CRM + Photo History + Tags
1	
2	**From:** Vega (Design Agent)
3	**To:** Koda (Feature Builder)
4	**Date:** 2026-04-15
5	**Stack:** Stack A — Next.js 16.2.3, Tailwind 4, shadcn base-nova, dark-first
6	**Sprint:** 3 — Client CRM + Photo History + Tags (Week 7–8)
7	
8	---
9	
10	## 0. Pre-Build Rules (carry all 20 from Sprints 1–2 forward, plus these)
11	
12	21. The `clients` table already has `tags TEXT[]`. Sprint 3 introduces `client_tags` as a **library table** (with color + icon metadata) plus `client_notes`, `client_files`, and `communications_log` as **new tables**. Dato must run the migration before Koda touches any page.
13	22. Tag chips on clients are resolved by joining `clients.tags[]` → `client_tags.slug`. The `tags` column stores slugs (`TEXT[]`), not display names. Display name is always read from the library.
14	23. Client detail tabs use **real URL segments**: `/clients/[id]/overview`, `/clients/[id]/appointments`, etc. — NOT query params. Reason: back-button, deep-link sharing, and CommandPalette navigation all work correctly with segments; query params break all three.
15	24. Archive = soft delete. `archived_at TIMESTAMPTZ`. Default query always appends `WHERE archived_at IS NULL`. Never use `DELETE` on clients.
16	25. `formatCurrency` from `lib/format.ts` is the only way to render money. No template literals with `$`. `tabular-nums` on every money and count display.
17	26. Avatar initials: `first_name[0] + last_name[0]` uppercase. Background: brand gradient `from-[oklch(62%_0.24_292)] to-[oklch(60%_0.22_230)]`. Text white.
18	27. Communications log is read-only in Sprint 3. The "Send SMS" / "Send email" buttons are stubs with `data-testid` and a `Tooltip` "Messaging available in Sprint 4".
19	28. `consent_minor` is computed client-side from `date_of_birth`: `differenceInYears(new Date(), dob) < 18`. It is a UI-only flag — do NOT store it separately. The existing `clients.consent_minor` column is the persisted version; update it on save.
20	29. Photo gallery on the client profile reads from `booking_photos` joined through `bookings` for that client. It is grouped by booking (not by kind across all bookings). Kind filters (`reference / before / during / after / healed`) are secondary within each booking group.
21	30. `animationFillMode: "both"` on every staggered list — this rule was in Sprint 1 and is repeated here because the client list cards are the most visible staggered render yet.
22	
