    window.location.href = checkout_url
  } catch {
    toast.error('Could not start payment. Please try again.')
    setCheckoutLoading(false)
  }
}
```

### 8.3 Post-Checkout Confirmation (Polling)

**Route:** `/book/[studioSlug]/[serviceId]/confirmation?token=[token]`

The `confirmation` route already exists. Sprint 4 adds a deposit-paid polling step to it.

**When `deposit_required === true` and `deposit_paid === false` on initial load:**

```
