**When `deposit_paid === true` (polling resolved or loaded directly with paid deposit):**

```
<div className="flex flex-col items-center gap-5 py-10 text-center">
  <div className="h-16 w-16 rounded-full bg-[oklch(58%_0.18_145/0.15)]
                  flex items-center justify-center">
