**Fallback (10s elapsed, still not paid):**
Show success state with "Deposit received" + note `"If you were charged, your booking is confirmed. Check your email for confirmation."` — do not show error.

**Polling implementation:**
```tsx
useEffect(() => {
  if (depositPaid) return
  let elapsed = 0
  const interval = setInterval(async () => {
    elapsed += 2000
    const res = await fetch(`/api/public/bookings/${token}`)
    const { data } = await res.json()
    if (data?.deposit_paid) {
      setDepositPaid(true)
      clearInterval(interval)
    }
    if (elapsed >= 10000) {
      setPollingExpired(true)
      clearInterval(interval)
    }
  }, 2000)
  return () => clearInterval(interval)
}, [depositPaid, token])
```

