`handleCancel`: POST `/api/billing/cancel` → sets `cancel_at_period_end = true` in Dodo. On success: `toast.success("Subscription cancelled. Access continues until {date}.")` and reload subscription data. On error: `toast.error("Could not cancel subscription. Contact support.")`.

