## 14. Toast Templates

All use `sonner`. Duration 4000ms default. `tabular-nums` on any amount shown.

| Event | Toast | Type |
|-------|-------|------|
| Plan upgraded | `"Upgraded to {tier}. Changes take effect immediately."` | success |
| Plan downgraded | `"Downgraded to {tier}. Current plan features active until {date}."` | success |
| Subscription cancelled | `"Subscription cancelled. Access until {date}."` | success |
| Subscription reactivated | `"Subscription reactivated. Billing resumes at next cycle."` | success |
| Card updated | `"Payment method updated."` | success |
| Deposit collected | `"Deposit of {amount} collected."` | success |
| Deposit link copied | `"Deposit link copied to clipboard."` | success |
| Balance collected | `"Balance of {amount} collected."` | success |
| Refund initiated | `"Refund of {amount} submitted. 5–10 business days."` | success |
| Payment failed | `"Payment failed: {failure_message}. Update your payment method."` | error (persistent, no auto-dismiss) |
| Checkout redirect failed | `"Could not start checkout. Try again."` | error |
| Portal redirect failed | `"Could not open customer portal. Try again."` | error |

Payment failed toast is `duration: Infinity` and includes an "Update now" action button:
```tsx
toast.error('Payment failed', {
  description: failure_message,
  duration: Infinity,
  action: { label: 'Update now', onClick: openCustomerPortal },
})
```

