## 16. Deposit Flow — Sequence Diagram

```
INTERNAL DEPOSIT FLOW
─────────────────────
Staff opens AppointmentDrawer
  → Step 5 (Deposit) appears when service.deposit_cents > 0
  → Staff toggles "Require deposit" ON
  → Staff sets deposit amount (defaults from service)
  → Clicks "Create appointment"
  → POST /api/bookings → creates booking with status='pending', deposit_cents=N, deposit_paid=false
  → Drawer closes, calendar/list refreshes

Staff clicks "Send deposit link" on appointment detail
  → POST /api/bookings/[id]/deposit-link
  → Server: dodo.checkout.create({ product_id, amount_cents, metadata: { booking_id, type: 'deposit' } })
  → Returns { checkout_url }
  → Client copies checkout_url to clipboard
  → toast.success("Deposit link copied")

Client pays via Dodo hosted checkout
  → Dodo fires webhook: payment.succeeded
  → Webhook handler (/api/webhooks/dodo):
      updates payments row: status='succeeded'
      updates bookings: deposit_paid=true, deposit_paid_at=now()
      updates bookings: status='confirmed' (if was 'pending')
  → Appointment detail auto-refreshes (polling or realtime subscription)
  → DepositStatus pill flips to 'paid'


PUBLIC DEPOSIT FLOW
───────────────────
Client visits /book/[studioSlug]/[serviceId]
  → Selects artist + slot + fills in details
  → If service.deposit_required=true → Step N: "Deposit required"
  → Client sees deposit amount + "Continue to secure payment" CTA
  → Clicks CTA
  → POST /api/public/bookings/[token]/checkout { type: 'deposit' }
  → Server: dodo.checkout.create({ success_url: /book/.../confirmation?token=X, cancel_url: /book/... })
  → Returns { checkout_url }
  → window.location.href = checkout_url

Dodo redirects back to success_url
  → /book/[studioSlug]/[serviceId]/confirmation?token=[token]
  → Page loads: deposit_paid may still be false (webhook processing)
  → Polling starts: GET /api/public/bookings/[token] every 2s for 10s
  → Dodo fires webhook → booking updated: deposit_paid=true
  → Polling detects deposit_paid=true → shows confirmation state
  → If 10s elapsed and still false → show fallback "Deposit received" banner


COLLECT BALANCE FLOW (post-session)
────────────────────────────────────
Staff marks appointment 'completed'
  → AppointmentDetailClient shows "Collect balance" panel
  → balance = price_cents - deposit_cents + tip_cents
  → Staff clicks "Collect {amount}"
  → POST /api/bookings/[id]/balance-checkout
  → Server: dodo.checkout.create({ amount_cents: balance, success_url: /appointments/[id]?collected=1 })
  → window.location.href = checkout_url
  → Client pays via Dodo
  → Dodo webhook: payment.succeeded → updates bookings: balance_paid=true, balance_paid_at=now()
  → Staff returns to appointment detail → "Balance collected" shown
```

