## 18. Accessibility

- All icon-only buttons (`<X>` dismiss, `<FileDown>`, `<ExternalLink>`) have `aria-label`
- Dialog/AlertDialog: `aria-labelledby` on DialogTitle, `aria-describedby` on DialogDescription
- Progress bars: `role="progressbar"` `aria-valuenow={pct}` `aria-valuemin={0}` `aria-valuemax={100}` `aria-label="{label} usage"`
- Focus order on billing page: PageHeader → Banners → PlanCard CTAs → Usage meters → Invoice table rows
- Keyboard: Esc closes all modals/drawers. Tab through plan cards → CTAs. Enter activates CTA.
- Touch targets: all buttons `min-h-[44px]` on mobile (Tailwind: `min-h-11`)
- Contrast: all badge foreground colors verified ≥ 4.5:1 against card background at dark mode

